    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n102908" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τεκτοσύνη</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>the art of a joiner,
